[l_braz_por]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Sabotar infraestrutura
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=A resistência no território inimigo tem feito esforços discretos contra a infraestrutura inimiga, mas até então não tem os recursos para causar um grande impacto.

[l_english]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Sabotage Infrastructure
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§LResistance in enemy territory has been waging a low-key effort against enemy infrastructure, but has so far lacked the resources to make a heavy impact.§!

[l_french]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Sabotage des infrastructures
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§LLa résistance en territoire ennemi a beaucoup visé les infrastructures sur lesquelles s'appuie l'ennemi, mais il lui manque pour l'instant les ressources pour avoir un réel impact.§!

[l_german]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Infrastruktur sabotieren
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=Der lokale Widerstand unternimmt immer wieder kleinere Sabotageaktionen gegen die feindliche Infrastruktur, für mehr reichen die Ressourcen nicht ... bisher.

[l_japanese]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=インフラへの妨害工作
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§L敵領地のレジスタンスはインフラに対して控えめな工作を行ったが、重大な被害を与えるには到底及ばない力しか持っていない。§!

[l_korean]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=기반시설 사보타주
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§L적지의 저항 세력은 적의 기반시설을 상대로 은밀한 활동을 벌여왔지만, 아직은 중대한 타격을 입힐 만큼의 자원을 확보하지 못했습니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Sabotaż infrastruktury
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=Ruch oporu na terenie wroga prowadzi niewielkie operacje wymierzone w infrastrukturę wroga, ale nie ma zasobów, które pozwoliłyby wyrządzić poważniejsze szkody.

[l_russian]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Подорвать инфраструктуру
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§LСопротивление на территории противника планирует провести скрытную операцию против вражеской инфраструктуры, но пока что нашим союзникам недостает ресурсов для мощного удара.§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=破坏基础设施
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=§L敌占区的抵抗组织一直在低调地打击敌方基础设施，但到目前为止还缺乏产生重大影响的方法。§!

[l_spanish]
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure=Sabotear infraestructuras
operation_targeted_sabotage_infrastructure_desc=La resistencia en territorio enemigo ha protagonizado un esfuerzo discreto contra la infraestructura del enemigo, pero, hasta ahora, ha carecido de los recursos necesarios para provocar efectos graves.
